eling for the first Set.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strategy against Sana</h2><br>Sana is your companion to dispute the single-player matches. Sana\u2019s Artificial Intelligence is influenced by its mood during the match.<br>Think strategically to win the best-of-3 rounds!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813190/extras/7ae07bc88e695fae72e311beb6edb7b2.poster.avif?t=1728677024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813190/extras/7ae07bc88e695fae72e311beb6edb7b2.webm?t=1728677024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813190/extras/7ae07bc88e695fae72e311beb6edb7b2.mp4?t=1728677024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>If you\u2019re in trouble, you can use the roulette wheel to change the course of the match with a lucky move!<br>Just hit the Panic button.<br>You have a limited number of roulette spins in a game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes / Multiplayer</h2><br>Little Inner Monsters will feature different game modes that change the dynamics of the match.<br>You can play with decks of different amounts of cards<br>You can also play against a friend in the Multiplayer Mode.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813190/extras/1ac22ac448e73af8cdddf7984fc3b1cf.poster.avif?t=1728677024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813190/extras/1ac22ac448e73af8cdddf7984fc3b1cf.webm?t=1728677024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813190/extras/1ac22ac448e73af8cdddf7984fc3b1cf.mp4?t=1728677024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Even at a distance, you can express your feelings during the game.<br>In multiplayer mode, send emojis to interact with your opponent.<br><br>The game features art from Katia Numakura (@katia.numakura) and music from Tatyana Jacques (@taty_jacques).",
